---
layout: base.njk
title: Notes
permalink: /blog/
---
<p class="section-label">Notes</p>
<h1 class="page-title">Notes on what I'm learning.</h1>
<p class="writing-intro">What I'm reading, building, and trying to work through. Some of it draws on my work; some of it follows an interest or a question.</p>

{% set tags = collections.tagList %}
{% if tags.length %}
<div class="topic-chip-row">
  {% for tag in tags %}
  <a class="topic-chip" href="/topics/{{ tag | slugify }}/">{{ tag }}</a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="note-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
  <div class="note-item">
    <a class="note-item-link" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <div class="note-item-top">
        <span class="note-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="note-date">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
    </a>
    {% if post.data.tags %}
    <div class="note-tags">
      {% for tag in post.data.tags %}<a class="tag" href="/topics/{{ tag | slugify }}/">{{ tag }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);">
    Nothing published yet. Check back for notes on reading, projects, and things I'm learning.
  </p>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
